Package: postgresql-18-pgwrh
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, postgresql-18, postgresql-18-pg-background (>= 2.0.3)
Description: sharding and replica read consistency for PostgreSQL 18
 Distributes PostgreSQL shards across logical replicas using weighted
 rendezvous hashing. Includes pgwrh, pgwrh_ui, pgwrh_fdw, pgwrh_wait and
 pgwrh_gist_extra for optional GiST text-array searches.
 The optional controller console uses an external PostgREST server.
 .
 Extensions are activated explicitly with CREATE EXTENSION. Using the wait
 API also requires preloading pgwrh_wait and restarting PostgreSQL.
